{"parse": {"title": "无路可返-06", "pageid": 140192, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E8%B7%AF%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%94-05\" title=\"无路可返-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">无路可返-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E8%B7%AF%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%94-07\" title=\"无路可返-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">无路可返</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.9B.B9.E9.AD.94.E5.83.8F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"蛹魔像\">蛹魔像</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 蛹魔像</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Golem in the Cocoon</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>之后在“自由海风号”和南极的经历，维尔汀的行动报告里都有着详细记载。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>而这些就是我第一次佩戴面具期间的全部记忆了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>这次诊察的目的终究是了解你的心理状况，而不是发掘事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我希望能够听到你亲自回忆和评价这部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>好吧，这也是个整理记忆的好机会……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_chuchang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_chuchang\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_chuchang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-2_4_at_chuchang.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_chuchang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-2_4_at_chuchang.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_chuchang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-2_4_at_chuchang.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_chuchang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_xialou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_xialou\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_xialou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-2_4_at_xialou.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_xialou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-2_4_at_xialou.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_xialou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-2_4_at_xialou.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_xialou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_yewantanxin\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_yewantanxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_yewantanxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_riquanshi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_riquanshi1\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_riquanshi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-2_4_at_riquanshi1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_riquanshi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-2_4_at_riquanshi1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_riquanshi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-2_4_at_riquanshi1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_riquanshi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>太平洋的夜晚与南极都很冷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-314714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-314714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-314714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>……而关于卡穆塔和托阿，还有各位努库泰澳人，以及南极科考站的成员们，我很遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_at_30.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_at_30\"><img alt=\"3_7_at_30\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/Cg-3_7_at_30.png/600px-Cg-3_7_at_30.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/Cg-3_7_at_30.png/900px-Cg-3_7_at_30.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/Cg-3_7_at_30.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_at_30.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"536403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"536403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>她崩溃了，我们灌注的定律产生了过多悖论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-314714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-314714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-314714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>夺走他们的性命有违我的良知，但我必须完成使命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"536403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"536403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>她忠实地执行了所有指令，却忘了如何跳出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"536403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"536403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>设置一个阈值和对应的最高级指令，让她重新启动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"536403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"536403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>这会对她造成不可逆的损伤，但也没办法了，还有没用过的磁带吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"536403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"536403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-536403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-536403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天蛾人：</div><div>再设置一个关键词，确保我们可以主动干涉定律。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格蕾丝女士，把我的朋友们还给我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314718.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-314718.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314718.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314718.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-314718.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314718.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-314718.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314718.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>这真的很痛苦，我必须重新拧动发条来摆脱这种折磨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-624911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-624911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-624911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>♪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>♪……♫……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>重新启动需要狭窄的封闭空间，淑女格蕾丝的怪癖就能在这时派上用处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>随行的棺材成了绝佳的重启场所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……我对你表示同情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我不是需要同情的受害者，小梅斯梅尔小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>天蛾人改造了我的大脑，使它不受我的控制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>但人本来就无法掌控自己的思想，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>一切都是我下的决断，是我做出的行动，是我犯下了这些罪行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>看来你还保持着人格的同一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>虽然你不必急着向我告解，但如果能让你好受些，那就这么做吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>可我还是要强调，这不是一次审问，你的话不会成为呈堂证供。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>你条理清晰的样子令人安心，小梅斯梅尔小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你可能有些累了，不过我们还没有结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不如说，接下来才是重点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你的体检结果显示，你在第二次戴上面具之后产生了剧烈的转变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>为什么你可以逆转这个过程？你脑内的发条装置还能阻止已经产生的肉体变异吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>当时阿尔卡纳已经破坏了发条。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我怀着侥幸心理第二次戴上了面具，然后我后悔了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>再次面对祂时，我才意识到祂有多可怕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>当场死亡在那时都变成了一个可以接受的结局，可我连这也做不到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>结果来说，我说服祂放过了我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>什么？你说服了谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在记忆中深吸了一口气，以此下定决心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>可以停止人工梦游吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-314710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-314710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-314710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>你不会想在记忆中看到阿尔卡纳的，小梅斯梅尔小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-314710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-314710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-314710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>接下来的部分请让我口述。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>不……不要是……现在——不！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我不想……变成怪物……不要……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-501901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-501901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-501901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>格蕾丝，我的孩子，你回到了这里，却又要逃走一次吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>格蕾丝……不是我的名字！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>好不容易才……丢下了那些名字，摆脱了……控制……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>你是个特别的孩子，没有过去，没有信念，却决心离开我两次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>我希望你亲口告诉我，孩子，你究竟想要什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我还没有……真正地——ㄜ、活……活过……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>你想要一次真正的生命，想要真正的感情，被真正地爱着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>回到我这边来吧，孩子，我会再次原谅你，然后给予你真实，就像给予你自由一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>但哪一个才是你，莉莉？凯拉？塞西莉？格蕾丝？还是说……普帕？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>告诉我你是谁，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我……不、ㄨ——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>你否定这些记忆，但你也害怕失去它们，这令你不安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>因为你的自我建立在这些伪物之上，你害怕它们消失，害怕会坠落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>不！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我不是过去记忆的延续……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>就算没有过去……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>也可以在现在做出选择，去决定将来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我是……我是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>呵呵呵，你就像一只蛹，我的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>内在已经全部融化了，却还在挣扎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>我期待你羽化后的样子，现在让你成为门徒太可惜了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>让我们把答案留到下一次见面吧，留到你真正回到我身边那一天，我的无名者……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314730.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314730.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-314730.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314730.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>嗬——嗬——！！咳咳……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "无路可返-06"}}